# Brain CLI Canon Structure

```yaml
header:
  id: BRAIN_CLI_CANON
  intent: SPEC
  status: IMPLEMENTED
  priority: HIGH
```

## Structure
```text
brain/
└── cli/
    ├── src/
    │   ├── lib.rs
    │   ├── command.rs
    │   ├── router.rs
    │   ├── executor.rs
    │   ├── model.rs
    │   ├── lora.rs
    │   ├── kv.rs (pending)
    │   ├── replay.rs
    │   ├── inspect.rs
    │   ├── profile.rs
    │   ├── benchmark.rs
    │   └── help.rs (pending)
    └── Cargo.toml
```

## Commands
```yaml
P0_commands:
  - "hace brain model list"
  - "hace brain model inspect <path>"
  - "hace brain model verify <path>"
  - "hace brain run --model ... --prompt ..."
  - "hace brain chat --model ..."
  
P1_commands:
  - "hace brain lora attach <path>"
  - "hace brain lora detach <path>"
  - "hace brain lora list"
  - "hace brain lora verify <path>"
  
P2_commands:
  - "hace brain kv inspect"
  - "hace brain kv stats"
  - "hace brain kv flush"
  
P3_commands:
  - "hace brain replay --golden <path>"
  - "hace brain replay certify"
  - "hace brain replay diff"
  
P4_commands:
  - "hace brain inspect tensor"
  - "hace brain inspect block <id>"
  - "hace brain inspect rope"
  - "hace brain inspect sampler"
  
P5_commands:
  - "hace brain bench"
  - "hace brain bench q4k"
  - "hace brain bench lora"
  
P6_commands:
  - "hace brain profile list"
  - "hace brain profile create"
  - "hace brain profile activate <name>"
```

## Integration Flow
```text
Hace CLI
  ↓
BrainModule (dispatcher)
  ↓
BrainExecutor
  ↓
BrainRuntime
  ↓
BrainKernel
  ↓
Hacedle
  ↓
GGUF / LRO
```